``` Lab 11 - password spray: one source IP failing logon for >=10 accounts in 10 minutes (4625, bad password or unknown user). Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows field names. ```
index=wineventlog source="XmlWinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625 Sub_Status IN ("0xc000006a","0xc0000064")
| eval src=coalesce(Source_Network_Address, src_ip), account=mvindex(Account_Name, -1)
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count as failures dc(account) as distinct_accounts values(account) as accounts values(Logon_Type) as logon_types by _time src
| where distinct_accounts >= 10
| sort - distinct_accounts
